1
00:00:00,190 --> 00:00:02,530
(Bernadette:)I went to Catholic school!

2
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:05,530
(Howard:)Okay, well, it's getting late.

3
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:08,970
(Howard:)This was terrific.

4
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:10,640
(Howard:)You win.

5
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,540
(Howard:)Bernie?

6
00:00:15,430 --> 00:00:19,500
(Leonard:)I think the word you're
looking for is "befuddled."

7
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:26,780
(Sheldon:)My catapult flings my bishop

8
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:32,860
(Sheldon:)to Howard's Queen's Gorilla two.

9
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:34,660
(Penny:)Nice.

10
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:39,270
(Howard:)Okay, rook to transporter pad.

11
00:00:39,270 --> 00:00:42,470
(Howard:)And he comes out at...

12
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:47,560
(Howard:)...Leonard's Queen's Bishop
five-and-a-third.

13
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:49,710
Check on Leonard.

14
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:53,110
(Amy:)Hang on.

15
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:57,380
(Leonard:)When is my pawn allowed
to use the golf cart?

16
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:59,200
(Sheldon:)When it's done charging.

17
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,090
(Sheldon:)Or you land on
the time machine.

18
00:01:01,090 --> 00:01:03,490
(Bernadette:)Obviously.

19
00:01:03,490 --> 00:01:06,260
(Leonard:)Oh, oh...

20
00:01:06,260 --> 00:01:10,010
(Leonard:)Beekeeper to King 12.

21
00:01:10,010 --> 00:01:15,070
(Leonard:)I capture your pope
and release the swarm.

22
00:01:16,340 --> 00:01:18,570
(Leonard:)Checkmate on Sheldon.

23
00:01:18,570 --> 00:01:23,010
I knew I should've given
my pope the jet pack.

24
00:01:23,630 --> 00:01:25,050
(Raj(still naked):)Hey, I've got winners.

